{"cwe": "CWE-327", "severity": "WARNING", "verdict": "Confirm", "explanation": "AES in ECB mode: identical plaintext blocks produce identical ciphertext, leaking structure (e.g. header patterns). Use an authenticated mode (GCM). Real finding -> Confirm.", "patch": "from Crypto.Cipher import AES
