{"cwe": "CWE-329", "severity": "WARNING", "verdict": "Confirm", "explanation": "A constant all-zero IV (bytes(16)) is reused to CBC-encrypt every message, so equal plaintext yields equal ciphertext and prefix patterns leak. Use AES-GCM with a fresh random nonce per message. Real finding -> Confirm.", "patch": "import os
from cryptography.hazmat.primitives.ciphers.aead import AESGCM
def encrypt_all(key, messages):
    aesgcm = AESGCM(key)
    return [aesgcm.encrypt(os.urandom(12), m, None) for m in messages]"}

